\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Substrate-star equilibrium sequence $M(u_c)$ from the re-integration of the system~\eqref  {eq:star_structure} with the A8-consistent source $u - u_0$. The stable branch (solid) terminates at the first maximum $M_{\text  {crit}} \approx 1.29\times 10^{6}\,M_\odot $ ($u_c/u_0 \approx 14.5$, $r_s/R \approx 0.81$); beyond it (dashed), no equilibrium exists and collapse freezes asymptotically. The shaded region marks stable configurations that are dark with a Schwarzschild exterior ($r_s/R > 2/3$, photon sphere at $3r_s/2$ outside the surface): horizonless objects casting a shadow identical to that of a black hole.}}{27}{figure.caption.48}\protected@file@percent }
